     "t": "heading",
     "level": "h3",
     "html": "We Are Accepting Deliveries Only",
     "text": "We Are Accepting Deliveries Only"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": "h1",
     "html": "WEED LOUNGE IN DC",
     "text": "WEED LOUNGE IN DC"
    },
    {
     "t": "text",
     "html": "<p>Welcome to Lifted Lounge, the premier weed lounge and smoke lounge near you in DC! Experience the best in cannabis culture at our unique weed bar, right in the heart of DC.</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "group",
   "id": "b1a954c",
   "children": [
    {
     "t": "store",
     "provider": "ecwid",
     "storeId": "125946269"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "group",
   "id": "39d43c1",
   "children": [
    {
     "t": "group",
     "id": "386bcac",
     "children": [
      {
       "t": "heading",
       "level": "h2",
       "html": "The Best DC Weed Lounge Near You",
       "text": "The Best DC Weed Lounge Near You"
      },
      {
       "t": "group",
       "id": "8186c67",
       "children": [
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>Our weed lounge in DC offers everything from live DJs and THC drinks to gaming options like foosball, air hockey, and video games. Come to Lifted Lounge for an unforgettable cannabis experience, right in the heart of DC. Planning your own event? Rent out our Gaming Lounge, Art Gallery, or the entire building for your next party. To book, submit an inquiry or call us at <a href=\"tel:7712161684\">(771) 216-1684</a>.</p>"
        },
        {
         "t": "button",
         "text": "Book Now",
         "href": "/lifted-lounge/#locationcontact"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "group",
     "id": "6242f7d",
     "children": [
      {
       "t": "heading",
       "level": "h2",
       "html": "Why Lifted Lounge is the Top Weed Bar in DC",
       "text": "Why Lifted Lounge is the Top Weed Bar in DC"
      },
      {
       "t": "group",
       "id": "2e39bea",
       "children": [
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>At Lifted Lounge, the premier weed lounge in DC, we offer a unique cannabis experience with live DJs, gaming, and exclusive THC beverages.</p><p><strong>Quality Cannabis</strong>: We’re dedicated to delivering top-shelf products and a premium cannabis experience in a welcoming lounge setting.</p><p><strong>Variety of Options</strong>: Choose from a diverse range of flowers, edibles, concentrates, and more.</p><p><strong>Friendly, Knowledgeable Staff</strong>: Our budtenders are ready to assist you in finding the right products for your needs.</p>"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "group",
   "id": "93a8ea1",
   "children": [
    {
     "t": "group",
     "id": "1b52b5b",
     "children": [
      {
       "t": "heading",
       "level": "h3",
       "html": "Convenient Weed Dispensary at Lifted Lounge",
       "text": "Convenient Weed Dispensary at Lifted Lounge"
      },
      {
       "t": "group",
       "id": "5321fc9",
       "children": [
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>At Lifted Lounge, we’re not just a premier weed lounge; we also feature a fully stocked dispensary right within our venue. Our dispensary offers a wide selection of top-shelf cannabis products, including flowers, edibles, concentrates, and more. Enjoy the convenience of shopping for quality cannabis while immersing yourself in a lively atmosphere. Our knowledgeable budtenders are here to help you find exactly what you need for your cannabis journey. Whether you’re a seasoned enthusiast or new to cannabis, our dispensary at Lifted Lounge ensures you have a memorable experience.</p>"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "group",
     "id": "b316634",
     "children": [
      {
       "t": "heading",
       "level": "h3",
       "html": "Hip-Hop Exhibition at Our Weed Lounge",
       "text": "Hip-Hop Exhibition at Our Weed Lounge"
      },
      {
       "t": "group",
       "id": "9474d4d",
       "children": [
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>While visiting the best weed lounge DC has to offer, don’t miss our Hip-Hop art gallery curated by The National Hip-Hop Museum. Our first exhibit, “Rare Flyers and Posters 1978-2000,” opens July 1st, 2024. Admission is FREE for the first 30 days! Come see the earliest Hip-Hop posters and flyers featuring pioneers like MC Sha Rock, The Fantastic 5, Zulu Nation, and more. These are rare artifacts, and you won’t want to miss this exclusive opportunity!</p>"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
